@startuml
!pragma teoz true
== Bad I ==
A -> B ++		: ping   
note right: Lifeline extends\n past message
B -->? : log
& B -> A --		: pong
== Bad II ==
A -> B 			: ping   
Activate B
note right: equally broken\nwithout --/++ notation
B -->? : log
& B -> A 		: pong
Deactivate B
== Good ==
A -> B ++		: ping
note right: but not perfect:\n"log" too close\n to lifeline  
B -> A --		: pong
& B -->? : log
== Best ==
A -> B 			: ping   
Activate B
note right: Looks perfect!
B -->? : log
Deactivate B
& B -> A 		: pong
@enduml
